{
  "archetype": "scrum_product_delivery",
  "display_name": "Agile Scrum Product Delivery",
  "family": "iterative",
  "summary": "Fixed length sprints for evolving product features with a single accountable product owner.",
  "template_version": "2026.10",
  "states": [
    {
      "key": "product_backlog",
      "name": "Product Backlog",
      "category": "backlog",
      "initial": true,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": [
        "Story written in user voice",
        "Acceptance criteria agreed"
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "sprint_backlog",
      "name": "Sprint Backlog",
      "category": "todo",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [
        "Estimated in story points",
        "Committed in sprint planning"
      ],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "in_progress",
      "name": "In Progress",
      "category": "in_progress",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 6,
      "sla_hours": 72,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "code_review",
      "name": "Code Review",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 4,
      "sla_hours": 24,
      "entry_criteria": [
        "Pull request linked",
        "Unit tests passing"
      ],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "qa_verification",
      "name": "QA Verification",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": 4,
      "sla_hours": 48,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "ready_for_release",
      "name": "Ready for Release",
      "category": "review",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [
        "Definition of done satisfied"
      ],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "done",
      "name": "Done",
      "category": "done",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "blocked",
      "name": "Blocked",
      "category": "blocked",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": false,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": 48,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    },
    {
      "key": "cancelled",
      "name": "Cancelled",
      "category": "cancelled",
      "initial": false,
      "terminal": true,
      "wip_limit": null,
      "sla_hours": null,
      "entry_criteria": [],
      "exit_criteria": []
    }
  ],
  "transitions": [
    {
      "key": "plan_into_sprint",
      "name": "Plan into sprint",
      "from": "product_backlog",
      "to": "sprint_backlog",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "story_points"
        },
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "acceptance_criteria"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "return_to_backlog",
      "name": "Return to backlog",
      "from": "sprint_backlog",
      "to": "product_backlog",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "start_work",
      "name": "Start work",
      "from": "sprint_backlog",
      "to": "in_progress",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "assignee"
        },
        {
          "type": "wip_available"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "submit_for_review",
      "name": "Submit for review",
      "from": "in_progress",
      "to": "code_review",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "linked_artifact",
          "artifact": "pull_request"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "request_changes",
      "name": "Request changes",
      "from": "code_review",
      "to": "in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "approve_review",
      "name": "Approve review",
      "from": "code_review",
      "to": "qa_verification",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "engineer",
          "min_approvals": 1,
          "distinct_from_author": true
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "fail_verification",
      "name": "Fail verification",
      "from": "qa_verification",
      "to": "in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "increment_counter",
          "field": "reopen_count"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "pass_verification",
      "name": "Pass verification",
      "from": "qa_verification",
      "to": "ready_for_release",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "checklist_complete",
          "checklist": "test_plan"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "release",
      "name": "Release",
      "from": "ready_for_release",
      "to": "done",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "approval",
          "role": "product_owner",
          "min_approvals": 1,
          "distinct_from_author": false
        }
      ],
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "stamp_field",
          "field": "released_at"
        },
        {
          "type": "notify",
          "audience": "stakeholders"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "block",
      "name": "Block",
      "from": "in_progress",
      "to": "blocked",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "blocker_reason"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "unblock",
      "name": "Unblock",
      "from": "blocked",
      "to": "in_progress",
      "guards": [],
      "actions": []
    },
    {
      "key": "cancel",
      "name": "Cancel",
      "from": "product_backlog",
      "to": "cancelled",
      "guards": [
        {
          "type": "field_required",
          "field": "cancellation_reason"
        }
      ],
      "actions": []
    }
  ],
  "triggers": [
    {
      "key": "auto_submit_on_pull_request",
      "event": "external_webhook",
      "condition": "pull_request.opened and item.state == 'in_progress'",
      "action": "transition:submit_for_review",
      "description": "Moves an item to code review when its pull request is opened.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "stale_review_alert",
      "event": "time_in_state_exceeded",
      "condition": "state == 'code_review' and hours_in_state > 24",
      "action": "notify:reviewers",
      "description": "Nudges reviewers when a review has waited longer than a working day.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "blocked_escalation",
      "event": "time_in_state_exceeded",
      "condition": "state == 'blocked' and hours_in_state > 48",
      "action": "notify:scrum_master",
      "description": "Escalates blockers that have not cleared within two days.",
      "params": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "sprint_close_carryover",
      "event": "sprint_closed",
      "condition": "item.state not in ['done', 'cancelled']",
      "action": "move:sprint_backlog;label:carryover",
      "description": "Carries unfinished work into the next sprint and labels it.",
      "params": {}
    }
  ],
  "ceremonies": [
    {
      "name": "Sprint planning",
      "cadence": "per_sprint",
      "duration_minutes": 120,
      "participants": [
        "product_owner",
        "scrum_master",
        "engineer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Daily scrum",
      "cadence": "daily",
      "duration_minutes": 15,
      "participants": [
        "engineer",
        "scrum_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Backlog refinement",
      "cadence": "weekly",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "product_owner",
        "engineer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sprint review",
      "cadence": "per_sprint",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "product_owner",
        "engineer",
        "stakeholder"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Retrospective",
      "cadence": "per_sprint",
      "duration_minutes": 60,
      "participants": [
        "scrum_master",
        "engineer",
        "product_owner"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "roles": [
    "product_owner",
    "scrum_master",
    "engineer",
    "qa_engineer",
    "stakeholder"
  ],
  "cadence": {
    "type": "sprint",
    "sprint_length_days": 14
  },
  "metrics": [
    "velocity",
    "sprint_goal_success_rate",
    "escaped_defects",
    "cycle_time"
  ],
  "anchors": {
    "intake": "product_backlog",
    "rework": "in_progress",
    "release_transition": "release",
    "done": "done",
    "blocked": "blocked",
    "build_states": [
      "in_progress"
    ],
    "review_states": [
      "code_review",
      "qa_verification"
    ]
  },
  "description_text": "Workflow template: Agile Scrum Product Delivery (scrum_product_delivery).\nFixed length sprints for evolving product features with a single accountable product owner.\nStates in order: Product Backlog, Sprint Backlog, In Progress, Code Review, QA Verification, Ready for Release, Done, Blocked, Cancelled.\nTransition Plan into sprint moves work from product_backlog to sprint_backlog with required field story points; required field acceptance criteria.\nTransition Return to backlog moves work from sprint_backlog to product_backlog with no guard.\nTransition Start work moves work from sprint_backlog to in_progress with required field assignee; wip available.\nTransition Submit for review moves work from in_progress to code_review with linked pull request.\nTransition Request changes moves work from code_review to in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Approve review moves work from code_review to qa_verification with approval by 1 engineer.\nTransition Fail verification moves work from qa_verification to in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Pass verification moves work from qa_verification to ready_for_release with completed test plan checklist.\nTransition Release moves work from ready_for_release to done with approval by 1 product owner.\nTransition Block moves work from in_progress to blocked with required field blocker reason.\nTransition Unblock moves work from blocked to in_progress with no guard.\nTransition Cancel moves work from product_backlog to cancelled with required field cancellation reason.\nAutomation auto_submit_on_pull_request: Moves an item to code review when its pull request is opened.\nAutomation stale_review_alert: Nudges reviewers when a review has waited longer than a working day.\nAutomation blocked_escalation: Escalates blockers that have not cleared within two days.\nAutomation sprint_close_carryover: Carries unfinished work into the next sprint and labels it.\nCeremonies: Sprint planning, Daily scrum, Backlog refinement, Sprint review, Retrospective.\nPrimary metrics: velocity, sprint goal success rate, escaped defects, cycle time."
}